# Environmental Working Group (EWG)

> EWG is a non-profit, non-partisan organization dedicated to protecting human health and the environment by empowering consumers with breakthrough research, data, and education.

This file provides a structured index of EWG's toxicological frameworks, scoring methodologies, and database guidelines optimized for LLMs, RAG engines, and web-scraping AI agents.

